# Recruiter AI Assistant (RAG) — Walkthrough

## What Was Built

A floating AI chat panel on the **Applicants** page that lets recruiters query their applicant pool using natural language. Powered by Gemini 2.0 Flash with context-window stuffing (not a vector database — see [implementation plan](file:///C:/Users/Computer%20Arena/.gemini/antigravity/brain/1e1cf0f8-2782-44ee-9ef3-d47ab944ee51/implementation_plan.md) for trade-off analysis).

## Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A[Recruiter types question] --> B[React RecruiterAIChat]
    B --> C[POST /rag/chat]
    C --> D[ragController validates]
    D --> E[ragService builds context]
    E --> F[MongoDB: Jobs + Applications]
    E --> G[pdfUtils: Extract resume text]
    E --> H[Gemini 2.0 Flash]
    H --> I[AI Response]
    I --> B
```

